      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if a professional can even help with this. it doesnt feel like a sickness, it just feels like... inevitable. like the battery is just running out. it's exhausting trying to keep these lights on when i can feel them flickering every time i try to remember something important. i'm just so tired of fighting the dark.",
